\title{Cycle}
\date{2026-09-13T04:26:49Z}
\tag{algorithms}
\taxon{Definition}

\import{algorithms-macros}

\p{A \em{cycle} is a path which starts and ends at the same vertex and does not repeat any edges.  A \em{cyclic} graph is a graph containing at least one cycle.  An \em{acyclic} graph is a graph with no cycles.}
